  "title": "AGTTM Part 4 - Mobile Works",
  "abstract": "AGTTM Part 4 - Mobile Works provides comprehensive guidance for traffic management during mobile work activities where both the work operation and traffic control devices move continuously or intermittently along roadways. This standard addresses the unique challenges of managing traffic around moving work zones, covering activities such as line marking, vegetation control, road sweeping, and inspection activities. Key operational elements include requirements for vehicle-mounted signage, shadow vehicles, pilot vehicles, appropriate spacing between vehicles in the work convoy, and communication protocols.",
